{title: Piya Bole Piyu}
{artist: Shreya Ghoshal Sonu Nigam}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] Piyu bo [A] le piya bo [D] le,        kya yeh bo [A] le jaanu [D] na
[D] Jiya do [A] le hole ho [D] le,        kyon yeh do [A] le jaanu [D] na
[D] Dil ki jo baatein hain,        [D] baatein jo dil ki hain
[D] Dil hi mein rakhna pi [A] ya,        [D] Lab to na kholoon main,
[D] kholoon na lab to par,        [D] Aakhon se sab keh di [A] ya
[D] Piyu bo [A] le piya bo [D] le,        kya yeh bo [A] le jaanu [D] na
[D] Jiya do [A] le hole ho [D] le,        kyon yeh do [A] le jaanu [D] na
[D] Ek nadi se maine poochha,        itla ke chaldi ka [A] han
[A] Door tere peekha ghar hai,        balkhaake chaldi ka [D] han
[D] Thoda woh ghabraayi,        [D] thoda sa sharmaayi
[D] Ujhli yahaan se wa [A] haan,        [D] Saagar se milne ka [D]
uska jo sapna tha meri hi tarah pi [A] ya,        [D] Piyu bo [A] le piya bo [D] le
kya yeh bo [A] le jaanu [D] na,        [D] Jiya do [A] le hole ho [D] le
kyon yeh do [A] le jaanu [D] na
